  "solution": {
    "text": "For <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be defined <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Range of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />So, the domain is not symmetric about the origin<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is neither even nor odd"
